    {"id":10,"difficulty":"Hard","question":"A number puzzle shows this sequence based on a consistent rule: 2, 6, 18, 54... Each term is derived from the previous term using the same repeated operation. What is the next term in this sequence?","options":["162","108","144","216"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Each term is the previous term multiplied by 3 (2×3=6, 6×3=18, 18×3=54), so the next term is 54×3=162."}
